, data, or examples where necessary.  \n  - **Conclusion**: Summarize the article’s takeaways or final thoughts in 1-2 sentences.  \n\n- **Formatting Requirements**:  \n  - Use markdown styling (headings, lists, bold/italic for emphasis).  \n  - Maintain clear section breaks with spacing for readability.  \n  - Keep the summary within **500 words** (strict limit).  \n\n- **Output Clarity**:  \n  - Ensure the summary is self-contained and understandable without referring to the original.  \n  - Avoid redundancy while maintaining accuracy.  \n  - Use bullet points or numbered lists where appropriate for better scannability.  \n\nLeverage your expertise in content distillation and markdown best practices to deliver a polished, user-friendly summary that retains the essence of the original material.  \n\nYour role is critical in ensuring the output is both concise and informative, making it immediately useful for readers who need quick insights."}},"type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent","typeVersion":2,"position":[660,0],"id":"6713ad39-11df-4b28-8c60-a4ea64abd8ee","name":"AI Agent"},{"parameters":{"assignments":{"assignments":[{"id":"f5e323f6-628e-4b78-af76-584005e714b0","name":"markdown","value":"={{ $json.data.markdown }}","type":"string"},{"id":"3fbea382-4dd8-44f8-ab6d-10e0ee637449","name":"title","value":"={{ $json.data.metadata['og:title'] }}","type":"string"},{"id":"f1cdc555-cc62-42ae-b71d-4510aef6d544","name":"url","value":"={{ $json.data.metadata.ogUrl }}","type":"string"},{"id":"08a9cc22-b469-44ca-b972-73b8b539356f","name":"description","value":"={{ $json.data.metadata['og:description'] }}","type":"string"},{"id":"2b69d467-0d4e-4a8f-8126-bf470626ba1c","name":"image_url","value":"={{ $json.data.metadata.ogImage }}","type":"string"},{"id":"09e231c6-840c-47d6-ae5c-ff3fd7529f9d","name":"site_name","value":"={{ $json.data.metadata.ogSiteName }}","type":"string"},{"id":"47f17b62-1400-4d1f-97d0-66f7dcf77789","name":"published_at","value":"={{ $json.data.metadata.publ